<title>UKRAINE: TENNIS-UKRAINE LEAD NORWAY 2-0 IN DAVIS CUP TIE. [CORRECTED 15:10 GMT]</title>
<headline>TENNIS-UKRAINE LEAD NORWAY 2-0 IN DAVIS CUP TIE. [CORRECTED 15:10 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>KIEV 1996-09-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ukraine took a 2-0 lead over Norway</p>
<p>in their Davis Cup Euro/African zone group one play-off tie (corrects from World Group qualifying round tie) after winning the opening singles on Friday.</p>
<p>Results:</p>
<p>Andrei Medvedev beat Christian Ruud 6-2 6-2 6-0</p>
<p>Andrei Rubalko beat Helge Koll 7-6 6-4 6-4</p>
</text>
